# Ruleset: official package registries
#
# Expects a proxy policy.
#
# A generic download set is the wrong unit for this network: it mixes working mirrors, GitHub Pages indexes that stall on the direct path, and destinations the GFW blocks. This file owns the official registries so their policy is a decision, not an inheritance. Blocked destinations such as gcr.io, pkg.dev, mega.nz and archive.org stay unclassified so FINAL carries them to a proxy.
#
# Policy is a proxy because the direct path answers slowly, which package managers feel on every metadata request. Measured 2026-10-30, three fetches each, direct from the LAN against the same URL through a Hong Kong exit: registry.npmjs.org/typescript 5.5 s, 10.2 s and a 20 s timeout against 0.3 s; registry.npmjs.org/react 3.7 s, 5.4 s and a timeout against 0.2 to 0.35 s; repo1.maven.org 1.0 to 1.5 s against under 0.15 s; pypi.org and files.pythonhosted.org about 0.2 s with spikes to 3.4 s and 7.7 s against under 0.1 s. The earlier DIRECT pin rested on flows completing, which says nothing about how long they took.
#
# Scope: the package body or index host of an official registry, in use here or unambiguous. Website, documentation, and static-asset hosts stay out and reach FINAL. GitHub-hosted registries stay in GitHub/GitHub.list. Chinese mirrors stay on the domestic path. Docker Hub stays in Library/Developer/Docker.list. NuGet stays in Library/Platforms/Microsoft.list.

# npm. Exact hosts only: DOMAIN-SUFFIX npmjs.org would steal www.npmjs.com and api.npmjs.org from the global classification.
DOMAIN,registry.npmjs.org
DOMAIN,registry.npmjs.com
DOMAIN,skimdb.npmjs.com
DOMAIN,replicate.npmjs.com

# Yarn Classic still publishes from this zone. Modern Yarn hits the npm registry above.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,yarnpkg.com

# PyPI
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pypi.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pythonhosted.org

# crates.io, including the sparse index and static.crates.io crate files.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,crates.io

# Go module proxy. Exact hosts only: DOMAIN-SUFFIX golang.org would steal pkg.go.dev from the global classification.
DOMAIN,proxy.golang.org
DOMAIN,sum.golang.org
DOMAIN,index.golang.org

# RubyGems
DOMAIN,rubygems.org
DOMAIN,index.rubygems.org

# Maven Central
DOMAIN,repo1.maven.org
DOMAIN,repo.maven.apache.org

# Packagist
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,packagist.org

# Hex
DOMAIN,repo.hex.pm

# CocoaPods
DOMAIN,cdn.cocoapods.org

# Anaconda
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,repo.anaconda.com
